{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/createoauth2clientrequest\/profile"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"profile"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ClientProfile"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CreateOAuth2ClientRequest\/profile","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"profile","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"profile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ClientProfile","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK25CreateOAuth2ClientRequestV7profileAA0E7ProfileOSgvp","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CreateOAuth2ClientRequest"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"X5.1 — the security posture this client is registered under. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"standard\""},{"type":"text","text":" (the default)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is every AXIAM client that has ever existed. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"fapi2\""},{"type":"text","text":" turns on the whole FAPI 2.0"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constraint bundle at once, and the registration is refused unless it also sets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"require_par"},{"type":"text","text":", a strong "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"token_endpoint_auth_method"},{"type":"text","text":" (either mTLS method or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"private_key_jwt"},{"type":"text","text":"), and at least one sender-constraining mechanism"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tls_client_certificate_bound_access_tokens"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dpop_bound_access_tokens"},{"type":"text","text":"). See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"FAPI operator guide."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/CreateOAuth2ClientRequest/profile":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/createoauth2clientrequest\/profile","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"profile","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"X5.1 — the security posture this client is registered under. "},{"code":"\"standard\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (the default)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is every AXIAM client that has ever existed. "},{"code":"\"fapi2\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" turns on the whole FAPI 2.0"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constraint bundle at once, and the registration is refused unless it also sets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"require_par","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a strong "},{"code":"token_endpoint_auth_method","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (either mTLS method or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"private_key_jwt","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and at least one sender-constraining mechanism"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"tls_client_certificate_bound_access_tokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"dpop_bound_access_tokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"FAPI operator guide."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"profile"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO","text":"ClientProfile"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CreateOAuth2ClientRequest\/profile","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile","abstract":[{"text":"Which security posture a client is registered under (X5.1). This is the FAPI “one switch”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"FAPI 2.0 is not a single feature but a bundle of constraints — mandatory PAR, mandatory PKCE","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"S256"},{"type":"text","text":", mandatory strong client authentication, mandatory sender-constrained tokens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"nearly","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change at all, because "},{"identifier":"Self::Standard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and every row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it.","type":"text"}],"title":"ClientProfile","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClientProfile"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClientProfile"}]},"Self::Standard":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Standard"}],"identifier":"Self::Standard","url":"Self::Standard","type":"link","title":"Standard"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/CreateOAuth2ClientRequest":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CreateOAuth2ClientRequest"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CreateOAuth2ClientRequest","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/createoauth2clientrequest","title":"CreateOAuth2ClientRequest","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"CreateOAuth2ClientRequest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" schema."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CreateOAuth2ClientRequest"}]}}}